       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             TSWCCRSTCK.
       AUTHOR.                 BARAONA.
       DATE-WRITTEN.           08/31/21.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.           GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
      *REMARKS.
      *****************************************************************
      ** This program reads input-output file PZFPMMCC0,
      ** taking each record that has the process flag = Y,
      ** and either restricting or unrestricting that user's ability to
      ** make storeroom withdrawals.  The process flag = N when completed.
      **
      ** File PZFPMMCC0 can be loaded manually or by the user uploading
      ** a .CSV file through the mfg webpage. The records are retained for
      ** historical purposes. Only records with a Y are processed.
      **
      ** This is part of the conversion to PM from MMIS.
      **
      ** Input -  PZFPMMCC0 (data loaded from webpage) or manually.
      ** Update - MCFPMM0300 Personnel file.
      **
      ** RFC 1122593  CD 5106272  CPPI 2020-01196736
      *****************************************************************
      *
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.    IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.    IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

      *PZFPMMCC0  MMIS Restrict Storeroom Users.Physical table. (I-O) UPDATE
           SELECT MMRESTRICC
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-PZFPMMCC0
                  ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
                  ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

      *MCFLMM0301 PERSONNEL FILE WITH CC#, NAME AND USER ID    (I-O) UPDATE
           SELECT PER-PERSON-PC-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0301
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.


       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MMRESTRICC
           RECORD CONTAINS 30 CHARACTERS.

       01  PZFPMMCC0-REC.
           05  MMCLOCKNUM           PIC X(10).
           05  RESTRICTYN           PIC X(01).
           05  PRODDATE    COMP-3   PIC S9(07).
           05  PRODTIME    COMP-3   PIC S9(06).
           05  USERID               PIC X(10).
           05  PROCESSYN            PIC X(01).

       FD  PER-PERSON-PC-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  PER-PERSON-PC-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPMM0300  OF MCFLMM0301.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".

       01  PERPAD-BREAKDOWN.
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      *      Storeroom restriction flag. Can't withdraw if set to 'Y'.
           05  SW-RESTRCT-FLAG          PIC X(01) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(01) VALUE SPACES.

      **************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
      **************************************************************
       000-MAIN.
           OPEN I-O     MMRESTRICC
                        PER-PERSON-PC-I.

      * Position to beginning of MMRESTRICC (Clock cards to be restricted).
           MOVE SPACES TO MMCLOCKNUM.

           READ MMRESTRICC NEXT RECORD
               AT END CONTINUE.

           PERFORM 200-PROCESS-FILE
               UNTIL FILE-STATUS NOT = "00".

       999-EOJ.
           CLOSE MMRESTRICC
                 PER-PERSON-PC-I.
           STOP RUN.

      *   Read PZFPMMCC0 (MMRESTRICC) then use the clockcard # to
      *       restrict that record in MCFLMM0300.

       200-PROCESS-FILE.
      *    Should this record be processed? Yes-get matching MM0300 record
           IF PROCESSYN = "Y"
               MOVE MMCLOCKNUM TO PERCCNUM OF PER-PERSON-PC-I
               PERFORM 400-READ-PERSONNEL
               IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
      *            Set the 3rd char. of perpad to Y for restricted from
      *            storeroom withdrawals. N or blank allows them to withdraw.

                   MOVE PERPAD TO PERPAD-BREAKDOWN
                   PERFORM 210-RESTRICT-YES-NO
                   MOVE PERPAD-BREAKDOWN TO PERPAD
      *            Write the Y or N to MM0300

                   PERFORM 510-UPDATE-PERSONNEL
                   MOVE "N" TO PROCESSYN
      *            N indicates this record was processed.

                   PERFORM 500-UPDATE-PZFPMMCC0
               ELSE
                   DISPLAY "CLOCK CARD TO UPDATE NOT FOUND " MMCLOCKNUM
                   MOVE "N" TO PROCESSYN
                   PERFORM 500-UPDATE-PZFPMMCC0.

           READ MMRESTRICC NEXT RECORD
               AT END CONTINUE.

       210-RESTRICT-YES-NO.
      *See if user is to be restricted (Y) or unrestricted (N).
           IF RESTRICTYN = "Y"
               MOVE "Y" TO SW-RESTRCT-FLAG
           ELSE
               IF RESTRICTYN = "N"
                   MOVE "N" TO SW-RESTRCT-FLAG.

       400-READ-PERSONNEL.
           READ PER-PERSON-PC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

       500-UPDATE-PZFPMMCC0.
      *    This record has been processed.
           REWRITE PZFPMMCC0-REC.

       510-UPDATE-PERSONNEL.
      * This user can/cannot process a storeroom withdrawal.
                   REWRITE PER-PERSON-PC-REC-I
                       INVALID KEY
                           DISPLAY "BAD REWRITE OF PERSONNEL" MMCLOCKNUM
                           DISPLAY "MM0300 F-STS= " FILE-STATUS
                           MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
